# Visual QA byproducts. The pattern contains a slash, so it anchors to this file's
# own directory — .prettydocs/ is self-contained and needs no entry in the project's
# root .gitignore. The committed artefacts are the .svg files in docs/assets/ plus
# each visual's viz.json; the asset is its own source, so there is nothing else to
# keep.
src/**/_qa/
